 and adorn yourself with cosmetics that resonate with your distinctive style.\n\nNavigate through the game with caution, as you must survive encounters with roaming entities. Dodge and weave, avoiding capture at all costs. Average Monkey Game offers an adrenaline-packed adventure where every move counts!", "short_description": "Average Monkey Game is a fun casual/horror game that you can talk to people and can even maybe make friends, this game is overall very good and fun."}]}, "developer_name": "UselessCompany", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/averagemonkeygame/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shrimps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/averagemonkeygame", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "7988984661116731"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "246245911874539"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "246245911874539"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1709140200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "246245911874539"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "8199446660070529", "version": "0.0.4"}, "id": "402225255792089", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_fo